Package: kwin-fusion
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: kwin-common-fusion (= ${binary:Version}),
         kwin-libs-fusion (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Replaces: kwin
Conflicts: kwin
Provides: kwin
Description: KDE Window Manager — the Plasma Fusion fork (the full profile's compositor)
 The maintained KWin fork for the Plasma Fusion full profile: the native transient
 tiling sequence (guarded ownership, exact-A restoration, the completion boundary,
 the command-intent matrix, the capture filter, the context release, the QML facade).
 The stock profile never installs this package.

Package: kwin-common-fusion
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
Replaces: kwin-common
Conflicts: kwin-common
Provides: kwin-common
Description: KWin common files — the Plasma Fusion fork
 Shared files for the Plasma Fusion fork of KWin.

Package: kwin-libs-fusion
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
Replaces: kwin-libs
Conflicts: kwin-libs
Provides: kwin-libs
Description: KWin libraries — the Plasma Fusion fork
 The libraries for the Plasma Fusion fork of KWin.

Package: plasma-fusion-full
Architecture: all
Depends: plasma-fusion (= ${source:Version}),
         plasma-fusion-decoration (= ${source:Version}),
         plasma-fusion-settings (= ${source:Version}),
         plasma-fusion-navigation (= ${source:Version}),
         plasma-fusion-quicklook (= ${source:Version}),
         plasma-fusion-copytext (= ${source:Version}),
         kwin-fusion (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: The Plasma Fusion full profile: the desktop with the pinned KWin fork
 The full profile of Plasma Fusion (ADR 0001): the complete desktop with the
 maintained KWin fork pinned at one exact version. The fork receives KWin security
 updates on its weekly integration cadence, which can lag the distribution by days.
 Users who cannot accept that use the stock profile.
